{"productId": "36f3571c-9849-4f4d-8787-b20b5ca88cdc", "modelName": "Hybrid Turkey", "modelDescription": "Taking the two best shot sizes, custom materials, and our patented stacked-load technology, we engineered a shell that brings real affordable performance to every turkey hunter, without the price tag of pure TSS. Our new Hybrid 5/9 Stacked Turkey Load \u2014 available in 12 and 20 gauge \u2014 layers nickel-plated lead stacked over high-density tungsten, giving hunters the reliable energy and tight, even patterns they expect from MIGRA. A refined buffer system, sealed crimp, and overshot card keep moisture out and stabilize the payload for consistent performance in any conditions. With 200 high-density tungsten pellets in each shell, this Hybrid load delivers the confidence, pattern integrity, and energy needed when the moment finally comes together\n\n", "manufacturerName": "Migra Ammunition", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": false, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "38548a39-8b82-46a8-9565-abfa85837f16", "description": "Migra Hybrid Turkey HD Tungsten/Nickel Plated Lead Stack Shotshells, 20ga, 3\", 1-1/2oz, 1100 fps, #5 & #9, 5 Round\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/5c38e870-9f20-4272-833c-f4017dd81b5d"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "T-20HYB5-9", "upc": "850060794872", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "871fedde-1205-44dd-a27a-10e1f37252e4", "attributeName": "Shot Type", "attributeValueId": "d1e2c8f6-9165-4917-9d1a-45703fdd0e29", "valueName": "Tungsten Alloy Shot"}, {"attributeNameId": "0e06c338-04eb-4f14-a75b-82e2c1f9646c", "attributeName": "Shot Size", "attributeValueId": "ea93180b-4e1f-4f81-a741-c0f4c58fc7d1", "valueName": "#5 and #9"}, {"attributeNameId": "7843e156-385b-4bf5-9161-71afae56011a", "attributeName": "Shot Weight", "attributeValueId": "3203b307-62a2-48ae-bcb5-293b36c92250", "valueName": "1-1/2 Ounce"}, {"attributeNameId": "a35c0186-af3e-497d-94bd-6cc089b3f0a4", "attributeName": "Cartridge", "attrib